sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant SIM as 模拟器
    participant MQ as EMQX Broker
    participant GW as Go 网关
    participant TD as TDengine
    participant PG as PostgreSQL 收件与告警
    participant RED as Redis
    participant BE as Gin 后端(告警引擎)
    participant WEB as Vue3 前端

    SIM->>MQ: publish device/telemetry (JSON 温度)
    MQ->>GW: 转发遥测消息
    GW->>GW: 校验并写 SQLite 队列，再 ACK
    MQ->>BE: 独立持久订阅同一遥测主题
    BE->>PG: 按 run_id + 设备 + seq 去重落盘，再 ACK
    GW->>TD: 动态建子表，50 条或 2 秒批量写入
    BE->>TD: 确认设备 + 时间戳 + seq 已入库
    BE->>RED: 更新 latest 最新值
    BE->>PG: 越限判断 → 生成或恢复告警记录
    BE-->>WEB: WebSocket 推送告警(≤10s)
    WEB->>BE: GET /api/v1/devices/{id}/telemetry 查历史曲线
    BE->>TD: 查询历史遥测
    TD-->>BE: 返回曲线数据
    BE-->>WEB: 返回历史曲线(≤2s)
